Package: fasterfetch
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Retro fetch tool that reads system info from kernel interfaces
 fasterfetch is a lightweight neofetch/fastfetch-style system information
 tool written in C. It reads OS, kernel, CPU, GPU, memory, disk, battery,
 and network info directly from /proc, /sys, and sysctl -- no shell
 subprocesses, no bloat.
